{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nPlots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement [[cite:obs-e41b1cc37c36797b4b00be9df896f3146f6e027c \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]].\n\nEach plot is forty square metres in size [[cite:obs-e41b1cc37c36797b4b00be9df896f3146f6e027c \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]].\n\nEach plot has a defined size, which is one unit of allocation as specified in the agreement [[cite:obs-e41b1cc37c36797b4b00be9df896f3146f6e027c \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"5934cee930d8ed59967b8e8b34aa8068e69630d6ddf4488639ffbaefd3dd7ca4","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added the plot size (forty square metres) and allocation rule as stated in the agreement source, with exact citations."}